2026-07-27T11:17:51.5850006Z i /tmp/RtmptvWABW/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:17:51.5850612Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:17:51.5851338Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:17:51.5851966Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:17:51.5852611Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:17:51.5853997Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:17:51.5855382Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
